      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْقَاصٌ</span></b>  signifies <i>Uprooted;</i> (S, K;) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْقَاضٌ</span>, with the pointed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ض</span>, <i>cracked</i> or <i>split,
lengthwise;</i> so says As.: but AA says, that both
signify the same. (S, O.)

